{"id": "section-body-07612", "title": "Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP)", "chapterId": "chapter-nine", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "RESPIRATORY DISEASE CONDITIONS", "Other Respiratory Infections", "Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-07612", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP)", "runs": [{"text": "Pneumocystis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "jirovecii"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pneumonia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PJP)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1603"}}, {"id": "body-07613", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP) is a potentially life-threatening fungal lung infection caused by Pneumocystis jirovecii (formerly known as Pneumocystis carinii). It predominantly affects individuals with compromised immune systems. It is a common Opportunistic infection in HIV.", "runs": [{"text": "Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP) is a potentially life-threatening fungal lung infection caused by "}, {"text": "Pneumocystis jirovecii", "italic": true}, {"text": " ", "italic": true}, {"text": "(formerly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "known"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Pneumocystis", "italic": true}, {"text": " ", "italic": true}, {"text": "carinii", "italic": true}, {"text": ")."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "predominantly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "affects"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "individuals"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "compromised"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "immune"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "systems."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "It is a common Opportunistic infection in HIV."}]}, {"id": "body-07616", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-07617", "type"