terstitial changes, small pneumatoceles.", "runs": [{"text": "Chest X-ray: may appear normal in 10-30% of cases. Predominantly perihilar distributed Fine reticular interstitial changes, small "}, {"text": "pneumatoceles."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1598"}}, {"id": "body-07628", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non pharmacological and Supportive Therapy", "runs": [{"text": "Non"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Supportive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Therapy"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-07629", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Maintain and monitor hydration", "runs": [{"text": "Maintain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "monitor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hydration"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1598"}}, {"id": "body-07630", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Antipyretic if there is fever", "runs": [{"text": "Antipyretic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "there"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fever"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1598"}}, {"id": "body-07631", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Continue therapy for bacterial pneumonia", "runs": [{"text": "Continue"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "therapy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bacterial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pneumonia"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1598"}}, {"id": "body-07633", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Scattered crackles and wheeze may be present, or rarely signs of focal consolidation", "runs": [{"text": "Scattered"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "crackles"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "wheeze"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "present, or rarely signs of focal consolidation"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07634", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Pulse oximetry may show low SaO2", "runs": [{"text": "Pulse"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oximetry"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "show"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "low"}, {"text": " SaO2"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07635", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Extra-pulmonary disease may manifest as hepatosplenomegaly, lymphadenopathy or ocular disease", "runs": [{"text": "Extra-pulmonary disease may manifest as hepatosplenomegaly, lymphadenopathy or ocular disease"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07637", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "CT-CHEST: More sensitive, shows perihilar and midzone Ground Glass Pattern, Septal thickening (Crazy paving pattern), pneumatoceles. Rarely consolidations.", "runs": [{"text": "CT-CHEST:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "More"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sensitive,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "shows"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "perihilar"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and midzone Ground Glass Pattern, Septal thickening (Crazy paving pattern), pneumatoceles."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Rarely consolidations."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07638", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Gallium scanning is highly sensitive but with low and variable specificity.", "runs": [{"text": "Gallium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scanning"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "highly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sensitive"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "but"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "low and variable specificity."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07639", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Sputum/BAL (PCR or DFA staining): Detect", "runs": [{"text": "Sputum/BAL"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PCR"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DFA"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "staining):"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Detect"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07640", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Pneumocystis jirovecii", "runs": [{"text": "Pneumocystis", "italic": true}, {"text": " ", "italic": true}, {"text": "jirovecii", "italic": true}]}, {"id": "body-07643", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Nutrition support", "runs": [{"text": "Nutrition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "support"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07644", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Oxygen therapy", "runs": [{"text": "Oxygen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "therapy"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1599"}}, {"id": "body-07646", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Therapy", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Therapy"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-07647", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: sulfamethoxazole + trimethoprim (Cotrimoxazole) (PO) 1920mg 8hourly for 21 days", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "sulfamethoxazole"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trimethoprim"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Cotrimoxazole)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "1920mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "8hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "21"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "days"}]}, {"id": "body-07648", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "In severe cases: cotrimoxazole (IV) 15–20mgTMP/75-100mgSMX/kg/day, 6-8hourly, may switch to oral after clinical improvement.", "runs": [{"text": "In"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "severe"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cases:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cotrimoxazole"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(IV)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "15–20mgTMP/75-100mgSMX/kg/day,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "6-8hourly,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "switch"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "after"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clinical "}, {"text": "improvement."}]}, {"id": "body-07649", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-07650", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If allergic to sulphur", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "allergic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sulphur"}]}, {"id": "body-07651", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "D: trimethoprim (PO) 12- 15mg/kg/day", "runs": [{"text": "D:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "trimethoprim"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "12-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "15mg/kg/day"}]}, {"id": "body-07652", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "AND", "runs": [{"text": "AND"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-07653", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: dapsone (PO) 100mg/day for 21 days", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "dapsone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "100mg/day"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "21"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "days"}]}, {"id": "body-07654", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-07655", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: clindamycin (PO) 450mg 6hourly or 600 mg 8hourly", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "clindamycin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "450mg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "6hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "600"}, {"text": " "}